1
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:21,757
The formidable Giri Double Six once
conquered the North Blue by force.

2
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,517
It's hard to believe
that tomorrow your regime

3
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,697
of terror abruptly ends
with a hail of bullets.

4
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:29,360
The wedding will be...

5
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,340
Soaked red with your blood. Bang.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,220
By the way, I would
appreciate one last favor.

7
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:46,917
Can you make it a point not to create
too big of a mess when you die tomorrow?

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,882
Just be mindful of the splatter.

9
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:51,857
If that wedding cake gets
one drop of blood on it,

10
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:54,352
Mama will be livid and no one wants that.

11
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,735
She'd tear the place down out of fury.

12
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,080
See this?

13
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:05,500
It's a 36-caliber Walker
Percussion Pistol.

14
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:08,880
The bullets it fires are
called Candy Jackets.

15
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:13,817
They are designed to be able to penetrate
through the toughest armor and shields.

16
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:16,560
As you can see, it works rather well.

17
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:22,380
Even your tempered body
can be pierced by these.

18
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:32,257
Can you imagine Sanji's face
when he sees the girl he trusted?

19
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:34,377
Pointing a gun right between his eyes.

20
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:35,520
Delicious!

21
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:39,860
It's gonna be good!

22
00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:45,380
That sad sack actually believes
that you have real feelings for him?

23
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:53,520
He doesn't suspect a thing.

24
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,317
The poor fool.

25
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,437
I wonder what kind of face he'll make?

26
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,777
Oh, I know!

27
00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:03,760
Maybe something like this?

28
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,597
They really nailed it!

29
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,200
I can see it now!

30
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:13,640
Or how about this one? Ready?

31
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:17,220
P-p-pudding, my sweet!

32
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,900
Come on, why aren't you looking?

33
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:24,239
This is hilarious.

34
00:02:26,140 --> 00:02:28,552
Don't like us making fun of your brother?

35
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,400
Live a little.

36
00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:33,257
Laughing can take the edge off.

37
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:34,516
Got nothing to lose.

38
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:36,721
You want to know how he proposed?

39
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,220
It was hilarious.

40
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:45,757
and pretty embarrassing, honestly,
he pulled his face back off,

41
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,977
and his whole head was fat and bloated.

42
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:51,457
