in this soft whisper.

49
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:40,057
You're my salvation, pudding!

50
00:03:40,140 --> 00:03:43,540
So if you'll have me, let's get married.

51
00:03:54,220 --> 00:03:58,640
Honestly, could you imagine
a more pitiful proposal?

52
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:08,400
Oh, what a riot.

53
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:13,760
What kind of idiot would win a
colossal failure like him? Seriously?

54
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:25,900
The nerve of you, trying to pass him off?

55
00:04:26,220 --> 00:04:28,749
At least bring me a
proper Prince to marry.

56
00:04:31,820 --> 00:04:32,650
What?

57
00:05:31,820 --> 00:05:35,177
Granting me courage, I
hope that we'll never stop.

58
00:05:35,260 --> 00:05:38,317
No matter where you
are, nothing is too far.

59
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:42,120
With our everlasting bones,
we'll reach it, we are home.

60
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:53,880
I'm so truly grateful I ran into
you on that day so long ago.

61
00:05:54,920 --> 00:06:00,820
We laughed every moment with tears in
our eyes till we knew we weren't alone.

62
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:07,960
The blowing wind came in
and joined us on our way.

63
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:13,217
And with it I know we'll rise.

64
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:15,937
We'll be flying up high.

65
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:19,040
Why, tell me why are you giving up?

66
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:22,300
Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?

67
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:25,740
Hey, what kind of future
do you think you have?

68
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:29,337
Your dream is already in your hands.

69
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:33,057
This love in my heart,
it will burn off forever.

70
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:36,897
Granting me courage, I
hope it will never stop.

71
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:40,017
And no matter where you
are, nothing needs truth on.

72
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:43,757
With our everlasting plans,
we'll reach it, we are home.

73
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,617
From the horizon, out on
the edge of the world.

74
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:49,617
If there was a place that
I'd want to take you to.

75
00:06:49,700 --> 00:06:54,520
Let's head for it then, but ask
for the way we already know.

76
00:06:55,620 --> 00:06:57,540
We promised it long ago.

77
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:13,377
You scream by your voice that
can't break through the silence.

78
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:17,177
Feeling defeated, it
crushes your helpless heart.

79
00:07:17,260 --> 00:07:20,317
I've got your back, I
swear, I'll always be here.

80
