this through to the end.

105
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:04,817
So I have faith in the both of
them to settle things on their own.

106
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:05,730
It's

107
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:11,377
all up to them then—you're useless,

108
