us to accomplish something essential.

114
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:34,320
So I must succeed.

115
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:36,581
That Poneglyph's message is ours.

116
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,290
Ma!

117
