150
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:37,680
I can assist with that! I'll do it!

151
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:38,977
I'll take you there!

152
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:42,001
And I can transport you
into Lady Galant's closet!

153
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:45,357
I'm a hand mirror in a guest
room on the second floor.

154
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,957
