for a floor over here.

155
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:52,940
Are any of you reflecting our buddies
Luffy, Nambi, Brooke, Pedro, or Sanji?

156
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,986
That's who we're looking for!

157
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,300
