160
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:02,100
Oh, that's right.

161
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,517
He wouldn't know what
everybody looks like.

162
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:05,835
Count on me, Cho-Bro.

163
00:12:06,060 --> 00:12:07,531
I'm a pretty good artist.

164
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:09,820
I didn't realize that.

165
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:11,330
Uh-huh.

166
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:21,340
it must be embarrassing to have such
a dim-witted brother yeah he's so dumb

167
00:12:22,180 --> 00:12:28,077
hey uh it looks like a little hostage is
gonna pass out soon if she croaks that'll

168
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:33,117
ruin our whole plan and that won't do we

169
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:35,788
still want her to attend
tomorrow's ceremony

170
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:55,237
me listen close dear sister-in-law i

171
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,997
can't have you bleeding
to death on us and i

172
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,837
certainly don't want to risk you ratting

173
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:02,760
on me for all my
unladylike behavior tonight

174
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,320
