175
00:13:19,460 --> 00:13:20,820
Just relax.

176
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,278
It won't take long.

177
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,220
Oh, come on.

178
00:13:58,420 --> 00:13:59,949
That wasn't so bad, right?

179
00:14:00,260 --> 00:14:02,436
Everyone carries unpleasant memories.

180
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,397
and trauma we'd rather forget,

181
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:08,640
how wonderful would it be not
to remember all that nonsense.

182
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:11,837
this is the power of the memo memo fruit,

183
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:16,140
Germa double six's
technology; sure is something.

184
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:20,897
despite being shot in the leg, you dragged
yourself pretty far—not that it matters.

185
00:14:20,980 --> 00:14:21,810
I'll

186
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:31,937
just paste this memory
from a soldier who was

187
00:14:32,020 --> 00:14:35,557
hit by a stray bullet
here and a quick edit.

188
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,470
and

189
00:14:40,620 --> 00:14:46,397
that should do it; your memories
from tonight have all been rewritten.

190
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:49,617
let's have a lovely
wedding tomorrow—shall we

191
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:54,217
call the soldiers have
them take her to the ward?

192
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:55,457
yes, ma 'am.

193
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:56,370
i'm begging

194
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:13,477
you to stop looping that's enough already!

195
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:14,580
enough already

196
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,820
Just knock it off!

197
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:23,840
We're destroying your arms!

198
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:25,280
You think I care?

199
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:29,800
I gotta warn Satya about putting
me in evil! She's a liar!

200
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:34,360
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

201
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:35,930
No!

202
