245
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:45,260
We have catching up to do.

246
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:48,340
Right now, you must escape.

247
00:17:48,700 --> 00:17:49,560
Thank you!

248
00:17:55,460 --> 00:18:00,640
She got here in bad shape, but
evidently it's already healing up.

249
00:18:01,180 --> 00:18:04,860
Her skin is tough, and it
heals unnaturally fast.

250
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:08,737
Jerma's augmented humans are
a marvel, to say the least.

251
00:18:08,820 --> 00:18:13,820
I believe she'll recover in time for
tomorrow's tea party after a good night's rest.

252
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:20,497
She should be in the clear,

253
00:18:20,580 --> 00:18:25,037
